## 3. Things this actor does NOT do (flag, don't paper over)

- **No per-video metrics.** `afanasenko~tiktok-profile-scraper` returns **profile-level**
  engagement (Median Views, Most Viewed Video Plays, Avg Shares, ER, Last Post Date) and up to
  **20 post captions** — it does **not** return a per-video views/likes/shares table.
  The marketing "last 30 days of videos" file therefore needs **either**
  (a) a second actor with per-video output (the repo's original
  `clockworks/tiktok-profile-scraper`), **or** (b) the "videos" file reframed to what this
  actor returns (profile stats + top captions). **Decision needed.**
- **Followers are partial for huge accounts.** TikTok hides parts of very large lists; the
  actor reports how many of how many it read. The page copy already says this — keep it.
- **Private/deleted/region-blocked profiles** return nothing and are not billed, consistent
  with "only pay for rows you get."

